<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This a PROBLEM!\rThe machine at the Power Plant broke,\nand we ain’t gettin’ electricity!\rNo idea when the Magnet Train gon’\nrun. I’m stuck. I live here now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thanks to whoever got the\nPower Plant back runnin’,\fthe Magnet Train back!\rPassengers gotta go through the\ngate for the ticket check...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Beep!\rSo sorry, but you need\na Magnet Train Pass to get on\fthe train. No hoppin’ the gate.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Passengers gotta go through the\ngate for the ticket check...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ping...fwip!\nHere go your Pass back.\rThis train ’bout to leave\nfor Goldenrod City.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy the attractive and magnetic\njourney!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Now arrivin’ at Saffron! Saffron!\nThe accent on the “a”!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy the attractive and magnetic\njourney!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Magnet Train is a SUPER-modern\ntrain that use electricity and magnets\fto go\fcrazy fast.\rBut there ain’t no electricity. It’s\njust a iron box right now. A expensive\fbox.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whew... How many times I went back and\nforth between Kanto and Johto?\fI lost count. I live on this train.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Before they built the station, there\nwas a house here.\rA lil girl they called Copycat lived\nhere. They bulldozed it. Progress.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo. You got a Magnet Train Pass?\nI got one.\rEverybody in Saffron who ride got one.\nYou ain’t EVERYBODY though.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lt. Surge: OH! I never thought I’d see\nyou out here! What a coincidence!\rI can feel BIG electric power around\nthis station!\rYou had a PIKACHU, didn’t you,\nprivate? Trade it for my FRENCH\fPIKACHU?\fIt say “Pika-ooh-la-la.” {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lt. Surge: My PIKACHU and\nyour PIKACHU up for a trade,\fwhat you think?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lt. Surge: Sheesh! ELECTRIFYIN’!\nLet’s trade ’em now!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lt. Surge: SHOCKIN’! I wanna share my\nPIKACHU love with you!\rI’m ready anytime. Just bring a\nPIKACHU, private. That’s an order.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lt. Surge: YEAH!\nI’m so hype! I’ll see you around.\fBye!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lt. Surge: WHAT? That ain’t the right\nhomie!\rI ain’t tradin’ my PIKACHU for nothin’\nbut a PIKACHU! At EASE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0535_T11R0601_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please keep your homies behaved or in\ntheir Hood Balls so they don’t lick\fother\fpassengers’ faces.\fThis happen DAILY. Good looks.</language>
	</row>
</body>
